From 23115c7be0a278cf32cfad32712e886fd071f68d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KEGustafsson <ke.gustafsson@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:42:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] feat: offer restart with no data

Restart from the admin UI opens a dialog in place of the browser's
confirm prompt. When cached values are kept over a restart, it offers
"Restart, keep data", "Restart with no data" and "Cancel", so the
server can also be started with a clean slate. PUT /skServer/restart
takes an optional { keepData: false } body; without one, data is kept
as before.
