From a5c788565882195e8e4213a16205588900f4d76f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KEGustafsson <ke.gustafsson@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:36:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] fix: match preferred source by its canonical name

preferredSources holds the canName form of the winning source, while a
cached value may sit under its numeric alias. The preferred filter
compared them raw and kept whichever source came first, so a saved
snapshot and the subscription bootstrap could pick the wrong source.
Among several aliases of the winner the newest value is kept.
